<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Special Metals started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Special Metals started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Leanne Baker initiated coverage of Special Metals Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set earnings per share estimates of $1.45 for 1997 and $1.85 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Stock was off 1/8 at 15.</p>
</text>
